<section aria-labelledby="registration-title"><h3 id="registration-title">Community licence and installation registration</h3>
<p>New v1.1.0 installations require free registration. Your Super Administrator email, configured public domain, random installation identifier, software version, installation status and acceptance timestamp are sent over HTTPS to the official portal. No campaign records, voter data, political activity, passwords or authentication secrets are sent. The optional phone field stays local.</p>
<details><summary>Licence terms — version 2026-10-12</summary><p>Community Edition is free to download and self-host. Registration does not create a payment obligation. Installation, hosting, maintenance, training and assisted upgrades are optional paid services. Existing application and dependency licences remain applicable. The owner must complete legal review of these additional terms before release.</p></details>
<details><summary>Privacy notice — version 2026-10-12</summary><p>Registration establishes an installation contact for essential security, compatibility, version and service notices. It grants no access to campaign databases. Promotions require separate consent and confirmed email. Installation details are retained while registered; contact the official portal for access, correction or deletion. Domain migration requires confirmation by the verified contact. Established installations continue operating during temporary portal failure.</p><p>Controller details, retention and rights processes require owner/legal review before publication. Read the <a href="https://campaignmanager.ng/community/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">official privacy notice</a>.</p></details>
<label><input type="checkbox" name="terms_accepted" value="1" required> I accept the licence and privacy notice, including required installation registration.</label>
<label><input type="checkbox" name="marketing_opt_in" value="1"> Send me optional newsletters and service offers. I can withdraw this preference.</label>
<p>If the portal is unavailable, retry Run Installation later. Configuration and existing records are preserved.</p></section>
